---
<section class="paths-section">
  <div class="container paths-grid">
    <!-- Path 1: Learn -->
    <div class="path-card">
      <div class="path-marker">01 / Developer</div>
      <h3 class="path-title">Build with it</h3>
      <p class="path-body">Get from npm install to a working client or server in minutes. The README walks through it; the API reference covers everything.</p>
      <a href="/api_doc/latest/" class="path-cta">Read the docs <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>

    <!-- Path 2: Use -->
    <div class="path-card">
      <div class="path-marker">02 / Industrial buyer</div>
      <h3 class="path-title">Use it in production</h3>
      <p class="path-body">For SLA-backed support, certified builds, consulting, and the commercial module ecosystem maintained by Sterfive, see the company that builds and maintains node-opcua.</p>
      <a href="/v2/commercial-use/" class="path-cta">Commercial support <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>

    <!-- Path 3: Sustain -->
    <div class="path-card">
      <div class="path-marker">03 / Sponsor</div>
      <h3 class="path-title">Sustain the project</h3>
      <p class="path-body">node-opcua is maintained primarily by one engineer at Sterfive. Sponsorship from companies that depend on the stack keeps the open project healthy and roadmap-driven. Founding Sponsor positions are open through Q1 2026 with permanent recognition.</p>
      <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/node-opcua" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="path-cta">Become a sponsor <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .paths-section {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background-color: var(--bg);
  }
  .paths-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 3rem;
  }
  .path-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    background-color: transparent;
    border-radius: 0;
  }
  .path-marker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .path-title {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .path-body {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }
  .path-cta {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .path-cta:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .arrow {
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .path-cta:hover .arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 968px) {
    .paths-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
